    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d47">

                <pb facs="0145" n="133" sameAs="frus:frus1940v01/pg133"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00110 European War 1930/285</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Assistant Secretary of State</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Berle</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to President
                        Roosevelt </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-04-06">April 6, 1940</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Subject: Sending a representative to the Mohammedan and Greek
                    Orthodox Churches.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Summary</hi>
                </p>
                <p>This matter was discussed with the Turkish Ambassador. He pointed out the extreme
                    delicacy of the question in Turkey, owing to the Turkish policy of reducing the
                    political importance of the Mohammedan church.</p>
                <p>He thought, however, that his government would consider the matter
                    sympathetically, in view of the objective; and suggested that we make inquiry
                    through Ankara.</p>
                <p>Recommended: That the inquiry be made by personal letter from the President to
                    President Inönü; we will try our hands at drafting such a letter, if the
                    President authorizes it.<anchor n="13" xml:id="d47-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>Attached: memorandum to the President;<anchor n="14" xml:id="d47-f2"/> also,
                    memorandum of conversation with the Turkish Ambassador.<anchor n="15"
                        xml:id="d47-f3"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>A. A. B[<hi rendition="#small-caps">erle</hi>], <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Jr.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d47-f1" n="13" xml:id="d47-f1-content">
